  "slug": "maximum-length-of-pair-chain",
  "hints": [
    "The input order is irrelevant; think about which endpoint should determine the order in which you consider pairs.",
    "A pair that finishes earlier leaves at least as much room for every future compatible pair.",
    "After sorting by right endpoint, keep the right endpoint of the last selected pair and accept a pair only when its left endpoint is strictly larger.",
    "Be careful: equality does not allow one pair to follow another."
  ],
  "title": "Largest Length of Pair Chain",
  "content": {
